config BR2_PACKAGE_PICO8OS_TRYBOOT
	bool "pico8os-tryboot"
	help
	  Set or clear the Raspberry Pi firmware's one-shot tryboot
	  flag (through /dev/vcio), so the next boot uses tryboot.txt
	  instead of config.txt. Used by pico8os-ota to boot a freshly
	  installed system slot once: if it hangs before the kernel
	  or init, a reset boots the previous slot again.
